sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant CS as Cart Service
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as Database

    Note over C, DB: Checkout Flow (Saga Pattern)

    C->>GW: POST /api/v1/checkout
    GW->>CS: Get user cart
    CS->>DB: Query cart items
    DB-->>CS: Cart data
    CS-->>GW: Cart with items

    GW->>OS: Create order
    OS->>DB: Insert order (status: pending)
    OS->>OS: Calculate totals

    Note over OS, IS: Step 1: Reserve Inventory

    OS->>IS: Reserve inventory
    IS->>DB: Check available quantity
    
    alt Inventory Available
        IS->>DB: Decrement available, increment reserved
        IS->>DB: Create reservation record
        IS-->>OS: Reservation successful
        
        Note over OS, PS: Step 2: Process Payment
        
        OS->>PS: Process payment
        PS->>DB: Create payment record (pending)
        PS->>PS: Call payment provider
        
        alt Payment Successful
            PS->>DB: Update payment (completed)
            PS-->>OS: Payment successful
            
            Note over OS, IS: Step 3: Commit Inventory
            
            OS->>IS: Commit reservation
            IS->>DB: Update reservation (committed)
            IS-->>OS: Committed
            
            OS->>DB: Update order (status: confirmed)
            OS->>NS: Send confirmation
            NS-->>C: Email/SMS confirmation
            
            OS-->>GW: Order confirmed
            GW-->>C: 201 Created (order details)
            
        else Payment Failed
            PS->>DB: Update payment (failed)
            PS-->>OS: Payment failed
            
            Note over OS, IS: Compensation: Release Inventory
            
            OS->>IS: Release reservation
            IS->>DB: Restore available quantity
            IS->>DB: Update reservation (released)
            
            OS->>DB: Update order (status: cancelled)
            OS-->>GW: Payment failed
            GW-->>C: 400 Payment Failed
        end
        
    else Inventory Unavailable
        IS-->>OS: Reservation failed
        OS->>DB: Update order (status: cancelled)
        OS-->>GW: Out of stock
        GW-->>C: 409 Conflict (items out of stock)
    end

    Note over C, DB: Add to Cart Flow

    C->>GW: POST /api/v1/cart/items
    GW->>CS: Add item to cart
    CS->>DB: Check product exists and in stock
    DB-->>CS: Product info
    CS->>DB: HSET cart:{user_id} (Redis)
    CS-->>GW: Item added
    GW-->>C: 200 OK (updated cart)

    Note over C, DB: Product Search Flow

    C->>GW: GET /api/v1/search?q=headphones
    GW->>GW: Check cache
    
    alt Cache Hit
        GW-->>C: Cached results
    else Cache Miss
        GW->>OS: Search products
        OS->>DB: Query Elasticsearch
        DB-->>OS: Search results
        OS->>GW: Results with facets
        GW->>GW: Cache results (60s TTL)
        GW-->>C: Search results
    end
